 <s:String x:Key="TodoDragSiblingOnly">未完成与已完成分组不能混排；移至中心可调整层级。</s:String>
 <s:String x:Key="TodoDragChild">松开后确认成为子任务：</s:String>
 <s:String x:Key="TodoDragBefore">放在前面：</s:String>
 <s:String x:Key="TodoDragAfter">放在后面：</s:String>
